:: Widgets Fishing Clothing [widget]
<<widget "fishingClothingCatchText">>
	<<set _clothingName to _args[0]>>
	<<set _clothingItem to fishingFindClothingItem(_clothingName).item>>
	<<set _article to _clothingItem.word is "n" ? "a pair of" : "a">>
	Something tugs on your line, but there's none of the fight of a fish behind it. You reel in <<= _article>> waterlogged <<= _clothingName>>. <<if $rng gte 90 and $world_corruption_soft >= 80 and _clothingItem.type.includes("school")>> You think you remember seeing these being worn by someone at your school. Surely they're fine. <<gstress>><<stress 4>><</if>>
<</widget>>
